cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Week, Brewed — the archive"
message: >-
  If you cite or reuse an issue, please cite the issue itself (title and date)
  and link to theweekbrewed.com. Quoted material from other news organizations
  should be credited to its original publisher.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Every published issue of The Week, Brewed — a weekly Sunday news digest —
  committed as published, with the sources behind each story. Corrections are
  appended as new commits; the original text is never rewritten.
authors:
  - name: "The Week, Brewed"
    website: "https://theweekbrewed.com"
url: "https://theweekbrewed.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/theweekbrewed/archive"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - news
  - newsletter
  - journalism
  - archive
  - provenance
